6. Instalação do AWX no Kubernetes
6.1 Pré-requisitos (no master-1)
bash
# Instalar make
sudo dnf install make -y

# Instalar kustomize
cd /root
curl -s "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes-sigs/kustomize/master/hack/install_kustomize.sh" | bash
sudo mv kustomize /usr/local/bin/

# Verificar instalações
kustomize version
make --version
6.2 Clonar e instalar o AWX Operator
bash
# Clonar o repositório
git clone https://github.com/ansible/awx-operator.git
cd awx-operator

# Criar namespace
kubectl create namespace awx

# Instalar o Operator
make deploy
6.3 Corrigir problema do kube-rbac-proxy (se necessário)
Se ocorrer erro ImagePullBackOff:

bash
kustomize build config/default | grep -v "kube-rbac-proxy" | kubectl apply -f -
6.4 Criar a instância AWX
bash
cat <<EOF > awx-instance.yaml
apiVersion: awx.ansible.com/v1beta1
kind: AWX
metadata:
  name: awx
  namespace: awx
spec:
  service_type: nodeport
  projects_persistence: false
EOF

kubectl apply -f awx-instance.yaml
